        <referenceFunction amount="1.0" category="chemicals" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="Contrary to clinker production, in this module no waste materials as fuel or secondary raw materials are included. Accordingly, no CO2-emissions from burning of waste are included. Other air emissions, assumed proportional to the fuel use, are estimated to be 88% of the emissions from the clinker calcination process, because the energy consumption is assumed to be 88% of the uses for clinker making. ;&#10;Synonyms: Klinker, Drehrohrofen, Zement, clinker, rotary kiln, cement; &#10;UUID: ec899361-d3ca-33a7-a607-626c0a054295" includedProcesses="Includes the whole manufacturing process to burn hydraulic lime (raw material provision, grinding and mixing; rotary kiln process), internal processes (transport, etc.). For the infrastructure only the rotary kiln is taken into account (as material consumption). No administration is included." infrastructureProcess="false" localCategory="chemicals" localName="Lime, hydraulic, at plant" localSubCategory="inorganic" name="Lime, hydraulic, at plant" subCategory="inorganic" unit="kg"/>
